  <body>
    <div class="concept-ribbon">
      <span>Concept preview (precision direction) for Absolute Integrated Health — built by Derek Jensen, not a live site</span>
      <span class="ribbon-links">
        <a href="/audits/absolute-integrated-health/demo">Warm concept →</a>
        <a href="/audits/absolute-integrated-health/demo-clinical">Clinical concept →</a>
